{"title":"Career roadmap · Automation Tester","role":"Automation Tester","summary":"An Automation Tester designs and maintains automated tests that verify software functionality, reliability, performance, and regression behaviour. This is a directly aligned career for BCA Software Testing / QA.","facts":{"Starts":"Year 1","Current degree":"BCA (Bachelor of Computer Applications)","Course":"BCA – Software Testing / QA"},"about":[{"label":"Career-route check","text":"Direct alignment. A strong entry route is BCA → QA/Testing Intern → Manual QA + Automation → Automation Tester/SDET."}],"intro":[],"horizons":[],"sections":[{"heading":"Career horizons","kind":"horizons","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Period","Career objective"],"rows":[[{"text":"2026–2030"},{"text":"Build programming, testing, automation and CI/CD fundamentals; enter as QA/Automation Tester"}],[{"text":"2030–2035"},{"text":"Specialise in Selenium/Playwright/API/mobile/performance automation and become Senior QA/SDET"}],[{"text":"2035–2040"},{"text":"Move toward QA Lead, Automation Architect, Quality Engineering or Test Manager"}],[{"text":"2040–2046"},{"text":"Lead quality strategy, test architecture, engineering productivity and AI-assisted testing"}]]}]},{"heading":"What to build each year","kind":"build","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["When","Build this","Learn from","Proof of progress","Gap it moves"],"rows":[[{"text":"Year 1 Sem 1"},{"text":"Programming fundamentals"},{"text":"Java/Python, Git"},{"text":"20–30 coding exercises"},{"text":"Programming"}],[{"text":"Year 1 Sem 2"},{"text":"Software testing fundamentals"},{"text":"SDLC, STLC, test cases, defects"},{"text":"Test plan + 100+ test cases"},{"text":"Testing fundamentals"}],[{"text":"Year 2 Sem 1"},{"text":"Web automation"},{"text":"Selenium/Playwright"},{"text":"Automated web test suite"},{"text":"Automation"}],[{"text":"Year 2 Sem 2"},{"text":"API + database testing"},{"text":"REST, Postman, SQL"},{"text":"API automation project"}